@startuml
title 5.2 Conversational Question — Narrative Response
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

actor User
participant "FindCareApp" as UI
participant "PromptDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "SafetyMiddleware" as SafeMW
participant "HistoryMiddleware" as HistMW
participant "NarrativePromptFactory" as NPF
participant "AboutService" as About
participant "llm_client" as LLM
participant "ValidationMiddleware" as ValMW

User -> UI: "What does a physiatrist do?"
UI -> Dispatcher: dispatch(PromptInput)

Dispatcher -> SafeMW: process(input, next)
SafeMW -> SafeMW: is_emergency → false\n(safe prefix: "what does")
SafeMW -> HistMW: next(input)

HistMW -> NPF: route(input)
NPF -> NPF: classify intent
note right: Deterministic rules:\nno provider/location keywords\nno clinical trial keywords\n→ NARRATIVE_QUESTION

NPF --> HistMW: PromptRoute(epic="narrative",\nintent="medical_info")

HistMW -> NPF: execute(input)
NPF -> LLM: chat(model="gpt-4.1",\nmessages=[{user: "What does..."}],\nsystem=build_system_prompt())
note right: System prompt includes\nRULE 3: medical advice disclaimer\nRULE 8: inclusivity guidelines

LLM --> NPF: {content: "A physiatrist is a\nphysician specializing in\nphysical medicine and\nrehabilitation (PM&R)...",\nstop_reason: "end_turn"}

NPF -> NPF: build PromptOutput
NPF --> HistMW: PromptOutput(\n  response_type="narrative",\n  text="A physiatrist is...\n  **Note**: This is general\n  information, not medical\n  advice.")

HistMW --> ValMW: output
ValMW -> ValMW: guard_text(text)
note right: URLGuardian checks\nany URLs in narrative\nfor validity
ValMW --> Dispatcher: output

Dispatcher --> UI: PromptOutput
UI -> UI: detect response_type="narrative"
UI -> UI: render Markdown text
note right: ReactMarkdown component\nrenders formatted response\n(not provider cards)
UI -> User: Narrative explanation\nwith Markdown formatting

@enduml
